[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     10[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ```
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     11[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     12[0m:[38;5;10m[49m The suite lives in `translation/tests/` (`menu.rs`, `cities.rs`, `routes.rs`,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     13[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `paths.rs`, `refcount.rs`, `heap.rs`, plus the harness in `tests/harness/`). It
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     14[0m:[38;5;10m[49m spawns both binaries, feeds them the same bytes on stdin, and compares all three
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     15[0m:[38;5;10m[49m observables. `tests/harness/mod.rs` builds the C program on first use if
